for all $q \geq 1$, and
\item $H^q(\text{Gal}(K^{sep}/K), M) = 0$
for any torsion $\text{Gal}(K^{sep}/K)$-module $M$ and any $q \geq 2$,
\end{enumerate}

**Typed interpretation:** Vanishing of Brauer groups is assumed for **every finite extension $K'/K$**, not merely $K$ itself; first conclusion includes all $q\ge1$ for $K^{sep,\times}$, second all torsion $G_K$-modules at $q\ge2$.

